Patch 2032: B33: strips and fans continue across DRAW words of one BEGIN/END, primitive restart in all strip paths (arrays, indexed list, expansion); floor holes gone (boot216 vs STRIP_CONT=0 boot217). Log base offset/index if set.

Source: the maintainer's other port, toolkit 16c7bd4.


